        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur WINCOVCOM, Windsor Entryset with Lyon Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Windsor Entryset with Glass Lyon Knob has a vintage look. It has a black glass Lyon Knob and a solid brass Windsor Style Plate and Deadbolt for an ornate entryset. This Single Cylinder Entrance Set is beautiful and is available in several finishes. The Windsor Entryset with Lyon Knob fits doors 1-3/4 inch thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Windsor Plate with Lyon Knob and Single Cylinder Deadbolt Combo Pack:\r\n</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Windsor Entryset Black Glass Lyon Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rosette and Deadbolt Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Material: Black Glass</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Height: 8.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Windsor Plate Width: 2.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Diameter: 2.11\"</li>\r\n<li>Lyon Knob Projection: 2.29\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Height: 4.20\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumb Turn Projection: 1.55\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder Projection: 0.66\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-WINLYOCOM-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262384\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur WINLYOCOM Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
